TITLE 1D transport: Ca/Cl initial, Na/Cl inflow, exchange in all cells

SOLUTION 0 Inflow
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

PRINT
    -selected_output true
    -exchange true

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -punch_cells 1
    -punch_frequency 1
END
